<p>I went through and did a purge, and the sentence which responded to your objection didn't make the cut &#8212; the electromagnetic pulse is our way of detecting what the object does, not the effect itself. I also removed a sentence explaining why we didn't just destroy it, but that's implicit in what happened to where it was originally stored.</p>

