<div class="title">Footnotes</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-514494-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-514494-1')">1</a>. Unless there's another part to the information transfer that can't be observed.</div>
</div>

